{"sourceUrl":"http://www.itpcas.ac.cn/new_tzgg/new_qt/202605/t20260511_8199676.html","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:49.331679+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"http://www.itpcas.ac.cn/new_tzgg/new_qt/202605/t20260511_8199676.html","html":"<div>\n<div><p><span><span>中国科学院青藏高原研究所（以下简称</span></span><span><span>“青藏高原所”</span></span><span><span>）于</span><span>2003年成立,是中国科学院党组根据国家经济社会发展重大战略需求和国际科学前沿发展趋势，在知识创新工程科技布局和组织结构调整中成立的研究所之一。研究所实行北京部、拉萨部和昆明部的</span></span><span><span>“一所三部”</span></span><span><span>运行模式，以</span></span><span><span>“引领科学前沿、面向国家需求、服务区域发展”</span></span><span><span>为宗旨，坚持</span></span><span><span>“高水平、国际化、重服务”</span></span><span><span>的建所理念，励精图治、艰苦创业，取得了一系列重要成果和重大突破，推动我国青藏高原研究事业进入了国际第一方阵。</span></span></p><p><span><span>青藏高原所现设有自然地理学、地图学与地理信息系统、构造地质学、第四纪地质学、矿物学</span><span>-岩石学-矿床学、大气物理学与大气环境、生态学、固体地球物理学、考古学等9个二级学科博士和硕士研究生培养点；</span></span><span><span>现</span></span><span><span>有职工</span><span>352人、研究生3</span></span><span><span>59</span></span><span><span>人，</span></span><span><span>汇集</span></span><span><span>中国科学院院士</span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>人、杰青</span><span>1</span></span><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>人（含双聘</span><span>1人）、优青等国家级优秀青年人才</span></span><span><span>24</span></span><span><span>人，各类人才约占在编研究人员的</span><span>1/3。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>一、基本信息</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>1.时间、地点</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>时间：</span></span><span><span>暂定</span></span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>周一</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>至</span><span>7月10日（周五）</span></span></p><p><span><span>地点：</span></span><span><span>北京</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>2.招生计划</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>预计</span></span><span><span>招收营员</span></span><span><span>80-100</span></span><span><span>人。欢迎具有自然地理学、地图学与地理信息系统、构造地质学、第四纪地质学、矿物学</span><span>-岩石学-矿床学、大气物理学与大气环境、生态学、固体地球物理学、考古学等相关地学专业背景的大三学生报名。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>二、报名与录取</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>1</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>. </span></span></strong><strong><span><span>报名</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>条件</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>1）202</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>年相关地学专业的应届本科毕业生，其中重点院校学生优先；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2）有志于从事青藏高原科学研究、并具备一定的科研潜力；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3）学习成绩优秀，大学英语</span></span><span><span>四</span><span>/</span></span><span><span>六级考试成绩合格。对专业成绩特别优异的学生，可适当放宽英语要求（须有大学四级英语考试合格成绩）。在校期间无违法违纪记录；</span></span></p><p><span><span>4）有意在青藏高原所攻读研究生者优先。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>2. </span></span></strong><strong><span><span>网上报名</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>1）</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>报名路径</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>：</span></span></strong><span><span>申请人</span></span><span><span>在</span></span><span><span>中国科学院智慧教育系统（</span></span><a href=\"https://kjxt.ucas.ac.cn/index.php/zh/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>https://kjxt.ucas.ac.cn/index.php/zh/</span></span></a><span><span>）中</span></span><span><span>“科教结合协同育人学生报名入口”</span></span><span><span>直接登录，点击首页右侧</span></span><span><span>“大学生夏令营计划报名”</span></span><span><span>栏目，注册后进入申请系统，浏览夏令营承办单位，</span></span><span><span>选择</span></span><span><span>青藏高原所</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>代码</span><span>80171</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>，点击</span></span><span><span>“我要报名”</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span>填写</span></span><span><span>说明：填写</span></span><span><span>“备注”</span></span><span><span>一栏（申请表最后一项）须填写如下信息：</span></span></p><p><span><span>A意向专业：****</span></span><span>    </span><span><span>B意向导师：***</span></span><span>   </span><span><span>C已/未获得推免资格</span></span><span><br/></span><span><span>请认真填写</span></span><span><span>以上备注信息</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>导师信息及专业详见研究所教育信息主页：</span></span><a href=\"https://itpcas.cas.cn/new_yjsjy/new_dsjs/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>https://itpcas.cas.cn/new_yjsjy/new_dsjs/</span></span></a></p><p><span><span>2）</span></span><strong><span><span>截止日期：</span></span></strong><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span><span>6月</span></span><span><span>20</span></span><span><span>日</span></span><span><span>前完成报名。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3）</span></span><strong><span><span>推荐信：</span></span></strong><span><span>夏令营实行学生</span></span><span><span>自愿</span></span><span><span>申请和专家推荐制，</span></span><span><span>申请人</span></span><span><span>须由班主任或辅导员和高级职称任课老师等</span><span>2位老师推荐。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>3. </span></span></strong><strong><span><span>提交材料（无需提交纸质材料，请按要求发送电子材料</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>即可</span></span></strong><span><span>）</span></span></p><p><span><span>6月</span></span><span><span>20</span></span><span><span>日前请按以下顺序</span></span><span><span>将</span></span><span><span>个人</span></span><span><span>电子</span></span><span><span>材料</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>扫描合并成一个</span><span>PDF文件</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>发送至</span><span>liuww@itpcas.ac.cn，</span></span><span><span>未</span></span><span><span>按时提交或资料不全者视为放弃申请资格。文件名和邮件主题用</span><span>“姓名-学校名院系</span></span><span><span>名称</span></span><span><span>-202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>夏令营</span><span>”的格式注明</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>例如：</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>刘雯雯</span><span>-中</span></span><span><span>国</span></span><span><span>科</span></span><span><span>学</span></span><span><span>院青藏高原研究所</span><span>-2026年夏令营</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><span><span>1）系统生成《中国科学院大学202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年大学生夏令营申请表》，</span></span><span><span>申请表最下方</span></span><span><span>须</span></span><span><span>本人签字</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>学院（系，所）领导签字盖章；</span></span></p><p><span><span>2）本科期间成绩单一份（须加盖学院公章），含专业排名</span></span><span><span>和绩点等信息</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p><p><span><span>3）两封推荐人签字的推荐信。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4）其它证明材料（包括身份证、学生证、已发表论文、奖状、英语六级成绩单及各类</span></span><span><span>获奖</span></span><span><span>证书等）；</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>4. </span></span></strong><strong><span><span>审核与</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>录取</span></span></strong></p><p><span><span>青藏高原所将组织专家对夏令营营员资格进行审核</span></span><span><span>，结果</span></span><span><span>将</span></span><span><span>于</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>月</span></span><span><span>30日前</span></span><span><span>通过电话或邮件</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>邮件会发送至申请人系统填写的邮箱，请务必填写常用邮箱</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>通知申请人</span></span><span><span>。</span></span><span><span>我们将根据入选名单建立</span></span><span><span>“2026年夏令营微信群”</span></span><span><span>，后续夏令营日程安排和其他重要通知将在微信群内发布</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>三、注意事项</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>1.费用</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>结算</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>：</span></span></strong><span><span>研究所将承担营员</span></span><span><span>夏令营期间</span></span><span><span>的</span></span><span><span>保险费、</span></span><span><span>统一食</span></span><span><span>宿</span></span><span><span>及市内交通</span></span><span><span>等费用</span></span><span><span>，不含提前</span></span><span><span>到达</span></span><span><span>或延后离开</span></span><span><span>的</span></span><span><span>费用</span></span><span><span>，往返交通费（火车或飞机）由学生本人承担。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>2.</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>购买</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>保险：</span></span></strong><span><span>夏令营</span></span><span><span>期间</span></span><span><span>将统一为</span></span><span><span>营员</span></span><span><span>购买人身意外伤害保险，</span></span><span><span>并</span></span><span><span>签署安全协议</span></span><span><span>书</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>3.安全须知：</span></span></strong><span><span>营员</span></span><span><span>应遵守</span></span><span><span>青藏高原所相关规章制度和</span></span><span><span>夏令营</span></span><span><span>活动</span></span><span><span>安排，</span></span><span><span>具体要求请见开营前发布的夏令营活动手册</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p><p><strong><span><span>4.</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>诚实守信：</span></span></strong><span><span>申请人填报</span></span><span><span>的信息须真实有效，不得弄虚作假。</span></span><span><span>一经</span></span><span><span>发现</span></span><span><span>不实信息</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>研究所</span></span><span><span>将撤销其夏令营学习资格，并通报该生所在</span></span><span><span>院</span></span><span><span>校。</span></span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span><span>联系人：刘老师</span></span></p><p><span><span>联系电话：</span><span>010-84249467、</span></span><span><span>010-</span></span><span><span>84249462</span></span></p><p><span><span>邮箱：</span></span><a href=\"http://www.itpcas.ac.cn/new_tzgg/new_qt/202605/t20260511_8199676.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span>liuww@itpcas.ac.cn</span></span></span></a></p><p><span><span>通讯地址：北京市朝阳区林萃路</span><span>16号院3号楼 青藏高原所教育处</span></span></p><p><span><span>申请网址：</span></span><a href=\"https://kjxt.ucas.ac.cn/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span><span>https://kjxt.ucas.ac.cn</span></span></span></a><span> </span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></div>\n</div>","textSha256":"fb3e3c0487ae2584cc4d01dcbe7792233ae3da9006937e78aef256e0c5b1974d","textLength":1878,"sourceSha256":"24c445078812d4ad79676c026d33c84c6f25bdb3ca72706f77d84c755f37df37","selector":"#zoom","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-0cf568ee95029352e1d2","title":"2026年中国科学院青藏高原研究所2026年度“第三极大学生科学夏令营”招募令","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:49.331679+00:00"}
